{
  "_about": "Realtime Database rules for the ONE Envirothon project (ENVSITE, 2026-10-28). The DEFAULT instance holds the roster, logins, releases, scores, teacher cards and boards; each family's study lives in its OWN instance (<projectId>-<familyId>, rules in `family` below). Merge of envirothon/MIRROR_SETUP.md §2 (what the Howe mirror writes: students/<sid>/summary + meta, release read-back, release/locked) and DESIGN_envirothon_console_2026-10-27.md §2.2 as re-cut by its DECISIONS block (logins/<uid> instead of the claim; the teacher creates logins; she edits/retires her own cards; boards; who drills). 2026-10-28: release/<cid>/final/{all/<station>, students/<sid>/<station>} = {date, ts, by} — the teacher's \"Open the final\" (write = the release/<cid> rule; final validates the shape and that by is the writer). 2026-10-28 ⚙️ CLASS SETTINGS (ENVCLASSSET): classes/<cid>/settings/{study,drill}/<name> (the class's values; written under the classes/$cid rule — a value for a setting Adrienne locked fails .validate) · students/<sid>/settings/{study,drill}/<name> (one student's overrides; the class's teacher or admin, and the teacher never for a locked name — set or clear) · settings/locks/<name> = true (admin only; any login reads it). 2026-10-28 🏫 THE CLASS RECORD (CPCLASS, DESIGN_class_platform_2026-10-28.md §3, §9): classes/<cid> is written PER CHILD — the class's teacher may write title, emoji, color (all three refused while classes/<cid>/locks/brand is true), season, start, goals, goal, calendar, labels, features, students, teams and settings, each with its shape checked; name, teacher, lockAt and locks stay admin only (admin keeps the write on the whole class, e.g. + Class). Paste `rules` into the default instance, `family` into every family instance.",
  "rules": {
    ".read": false,
    ".write": false,

    "admins": { ".read": "auth != null && data.child(auth.uid).exists()", ".write": false },

    "teachers": { "$uid": {
      ".read": "auth != null && (auth.uid == $uid || root.child('admins/'+auth.uid).val() == true)",
      ".write": "root.child('admins/'+auth.uid).val() == true" } },

    "logins": { "$uid": {
      ".read": "auth != null && (auth.uid == $uid || root.child('admins/'+auth.uid).val() == true || root.child('classes/'+data.child('cid').val()+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid)",
      ".write": "auth != null && (root.child('admins/'+auth.uid).val() == true || (!data.exists() && root.child('classes/'+newData.child('cid').val()+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid && (newData.child('role').val() == 'kid' || newData.child('role').val() == 'parent')))",
      ".validate": "newData.hasChildren(['role','familyId','kid']) && newData.child('role').isString() && newData.child('familyId').isString() && newData.child('kid').isString() && newData.child('familyId').val().matches(/^[a-z0-9-]{1,32}$/) && newData.child('kid').val().matches(/^[a-z0-9-]{1,32}$/)" } },

    "classes": { "$cid": {
      ".read": "auth != null && (data.child('teacher').val() == auth.uid || root.child('admins/'+auth.uid).val() == true || root.child('logins/'+auth.uid+'/cid').val() == $cid)",
      ".write": "auth != null && root.child('admins/'+auth.uid).val() == true",
      "title":    { ".write": "auth != null && root.child('classes/'+$cid+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid && root.child('classes/'+$cid+'/locks/brand').val() != true", ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length >= 1 && newData.val().length <= 40" },
      "emoji":    { ".write": "auth != null && root.child('classes/'+$cid+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid && root.child('classes/'+$cid+'/locks/brand').val() != true", ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length >= 1 && newData.val().length <= 16 && !newData.val().matches(/[A-Za-z0-9<>&]/)" },
      "color":    { ".write": "auth != null && root.child('classes/'+$cid+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid && root.child('classes/'+$cid+'/locks/brand').val() != true", ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().matches(/^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$/)" },
      "season":   { ".write": "auth != null && root.child('classes/'+$cid+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid", ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length >= 1 && newData.val().length <= 20" },
      "start":    { ".write": "auth != null && root.child('classes/'+$cid+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid", ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().matches(/^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$/)" },
      "goals":    { ".write": "auth != null && root.child('classes/'+$cid+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid", "$i": { ".validate": "newData.hasChildren(['name','date']) && newData.child('name').isString() && newData.child('name').val().length <= 40 && newData.child('date').isString() && newData.child('date').val().matches(/^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$/) && (!newData.child('note').exists() || (newData.child('note').isString() && newData.child('note').val().length <= 120))" } },
      "goal":     { ".write": "auth != null && root.child('classes/'+$cid+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid", ".validate": "newData.hasChildren(['name']) && newData.child('name').isString() && newData.child('name').val().length <= 40 && (!newData.child('pct').exists() || (newData.child('pct').isNumber() && newData.child('pct').val() >= 1 && newData.child('pct').val() <= 100))" },
      "calendar": { ".write": "auth != null && root.child('classes/'+$cid+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid",
        "days": { ".validate": "newData.val() == 'school' || newData.val() == 'noWeekends' || newData.val() == 'weekdays' || newData.val() == 'every'" },
        "off": { "$date": { ".validate": "$date.matches(/^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$/) && newData.val() == true" } },
        "$other": { ".validate": false } },
      "labels":   { ".write": "auth != null && root.child('classes/'+$cid+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid", "$k": { ".validate": "$k.matches(/^(section|sections|pre|post|item|concept)$/) && newData.isString() && newData.val().length <= 30" } },
      "features": { ".write": "auth != null && root.child('classes/'+$cid+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid", "$k": { ".validate": "$k.matches(/^(teams|boards|specialists|idFlash|mockRun)$/) && newData.isBoolean()" } },
      "lockAt":   { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().matches(/^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$/)" },
      "locks":    { "$k": { ".validate": "newData.isBoolean()" } },
      "students": { ".write": "auth != null && root.child('classes/'+$cid+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid" },
      "teams":    { ".write": "auth != null && root.child('classes/'+$cid+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid" },
      "settings": { ".write": "auth != null && root.child('classes/'+$cid+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid", "$part": {
        ".validate": "$part == 'study' || $part == 'drill'",
        "$name": { ".validate": "root.child('admins/'+auth.uid).val() == true || root.child('settings/locks/'+$name).val() != true" } } } } },

    "students": { "$sid": {
      ".read": "auth != null && ($sid.beginsWith(root.child('logins/'+auth.uid+'/familyId').val() + '_') || root.child('admins/'+auth.uid).val() == true || root.child('classes/'+data.child('class').val()+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid || (!data.exists() && root.child('classes/'+root.child('logins/'+auth.uid+'/cid').val()+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid))",
      "summary": { ".write": "auth != null && ($sid.beginsWith(root.child('logins/'+auth.uid+'/familyId').val() + '_') || root.child('admins/'+auth.uid).val() == true)" },
      "meta": {
        ".write": "auth != null && ($sid.beginsWith(root.child('logins/'+auth.uid+'/familyId').val() + '_') || root.child('admins/'+auth.uid).val() == true || root.child('classes/'+root.child('students/'+$sid+'/class').val()+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid || root.child('classes/'+root.child('logins/'+auth.uid+'/cid').val()+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid)",
        ".validate": "newData.hasChildren(['familyId','kid','name','at']) && newData.child('familyId').isString() && newData.child('kid').isString() && newData.child('name').isString() && newData.child('name').val().length <= 40" },
      "class":  { ".write": "auth != null && (root.child('admins/'+auth.uid).val() == true || root.child('classes/'+newData.val()+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid)" },
      "app":    { ".write": "auth != null && (root.child('admins/'+auth.uid).val() == true || root.child('classes/'+root.child('students/'+$sid+'/class').val()+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid || root.child('classes/'+newData.parent().child('class').val()+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid)" },
      "logins": { ".write": "auth != null && (root.child('admins/'+auth.uid).val() == true || root.child('classes/'+root.child('students/'+$sid+'/class').val()+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid || root.child('classes/'+newData.parent().child('class').val()+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid)" },
      "settings": { "$part": {
        ".validate": "$part == 'study' || $part == 'drill'",
        "$name": { ".write": "auth != null && (root.child('admins/'+auth.uid).val() == true || (root.child('classes/'+root.child('students/'+$sid+'/class').val()+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid && root.child('settings/locks/'+$name).val() != true))" } } } } },

    "release": {
      "locked": { ".read": "auth != null", ".write": "root.child('admins/'+auth.uid).val() == true" },
      "$cid": {
        ".read":  "auth != null",
        ".write": "auth != null && (root.child('classes/'+$cid+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid || root.child('admins/'+auth.uid).val() == true)",
        "final": {
          "all": { "$station": {
            ".validate": "$station.matches(/^(forestry|soils|aquatics|wildlife|cei)$/) && newData.hasChildren(['date','ts','by']) && newData.child('date').isString() && newData.child('ts').isNumber() && newData.child('by').val() == auth.uid" } },
          "students": { "$sid": { "$station": {
            ".validate": "$station.matches(/^(forestry|soils|aquatics|wildlife|cei)$/) && newData.hasChildren(['date','ts','by']) && newData.child('date').isString() && newData.child('ts').isNumber() && newData.child('by').val() == auth.uid" } } } } } },

    "scores": { "$cid": {
      ".read":  "auth != null && (root.child('classes/'+$cid+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid || root.child('admins/'+auth.uid).val() == true)",
      ".write": "auth != null && (root.child('classes/'+$cid+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid || root.child('admins/'+auth.uid).val() == true)",
      "$sid": { ".read": "auth != null && $sid.beginsWith(root.child('logins/'+auth.uid+'/familyId').val() + '_')" } } },

    "teacherCards": { "$cid": {
      ".read": "auth != null && (root.child('classes/'+$cid+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid || root.child('admins/'+auth.uid).val() == true || root.child('logins/'+auth.uid+'/cid').val() == $cid)",
      "$deck": { "$card": {
        ".write": "auth != null && (root.child('admins/'+auth.uid).val() == true || (root.child('classes/'+$cid+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid && (!data.exists() || data.child('by').val() == auth.uid)))",
        ".validate": "newData.hasChildren(['name','def','by','ts']) && newData.child('name').isString() && newData.child('name').val().length <= 120 && newData.child('def').isString() && newData.child('def').val().length <= 400" } } } },

    "boards": { "$cid": {
      ".read":  "auth != null && (root.child('classes/'+$cid+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid || root.child('admins/'+auth.uid).val() == true || root.child('logins/'+auth.uid+'/cid').val() == $cid)",
      ".write": "auth != null && (root.child('classes/'+$cid+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid || root.child('admins/'+auth.uid).val() == true)" } },

    "settings": {
      "edition": { ".read": "auth != null", ".write": "root.child('admins/'+auth.uid).val() == true" },
      "locks": { ".read": "auth != null", ".write": "root.child('admins/'+auth.uid).val() == true", "$name": { ".validate": "newData.isBoolean()" } },
      "whoDrills": { "$cid": {
        ".read":  "auth != null && (root.child('classes/'+$cid+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid || root.child('admins/'+auth.uid).val() == true || root.child('logins/'+auth.uid+'/cid').val() == $cid)",
        ".write": "auth != null && (root.child('classes/'+$cid+'/teacher').val() == auth.uid || root.child('admins/'+auth.uid).val() == true)",
        ".validate": "newData.val() == 'parent' || newData.val() == 'teacher' || newData.val() == 'both'" } } }
  },

  "family": {
    "_about": "Paste into EVERY family instance (<projectId>-<familyId>). Only that family's two logins (seeded under allowed/) read or write their own instance; the teacher and the console never touch it.",
    "rules": {
      ".read":  "auth != null && root.child('allowed').child(auth.uid).val() === true",
      ".write": "auth != null && root.child('allowed').child(auth.uid).val() === true",
      "allowed": { ".write": false }
    }
  }
}
